            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gapch1026"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I did not have prepared honey mustard so just used equal parts of yellow mustard and honey. And I did not have jalapeno peppers so just chopped up some hot giardinierra and added that. This had loads of flavor and was a nice taste change from \"traditional\" egg salad.",
